    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7209" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-πλασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shape, form, model,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀ. τῶν σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.56
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>representation, imagination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.14.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῆς διανοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.354
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>correlative term,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				331.30
			</span></i>.</div>
